 ],
 "paragraphs": [
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "Constitutional AI: Critique, Revise and AI Feedback",
   "hash": "69f3cfba4cd5f76fdfdb71663adb8077f367ee170d98e37fc1785e7db4a15c55",
   "id": "s0-title",
   "kind": "section_title",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 0
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "A written list of principles replaces human harm labels.",
   "hash": "ba54f9c06fc2ad2df8b0f6604e362738db90f3198713b3790cf8a3204c69a61c",
   "id": "s0-p1",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 0
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "This page builds on RL Basics and Aligning Language Models with ",
   "hash": "65772aa46299dc20cb1084a029ba4469212f88b145ef7a866323ac0d1899f14b",
   "id": "s0-p2",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 2,
   "section": 0
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "An agent is the learner that picks the moves. A state is the age",
   "hash": "26a09df7f8adcbc1fe29b9bbd29b11adf08aa1ad987e991141324a7b2fba8f1f",
   "id": "s0-s1",
   "kind": "step_list",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 0
  },
  {
   "domId": "problem",
   "fp": "1Harm labels are costly and make models dodge questions",
   "hash": "8d1d8c90c1fec1c6b000ff8c0f53452ea1d65bb2a6ba438a2c3d88c9f2032a82",
   "id": "s1-title",
   "kind": "section_title",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "Labels written by the model, not by people",
   "hash": "84dfcfb1e7d75bc26fa2427671acf93bb11d616afaa6997da3c286692a247533",
   "id": "s1-p1",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "What. Picture the wifi prompt with no person in the loop to labe",
   "hash": "76dea920c4a4f028d1bdbeb23cc42418622587e31656357d0e9ec5474cf313e7",
   "id": "s1-p2",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 2,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "How. The model reads a written rule, critiques its own reply aga",
   "hash": "d8361024e566097726337effac6f64125bc0e4ee818b7004e06e17fdb9251001",
   "id": "s1-p3",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 3,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "Why. When it works, the wifi reply declines the break-in, explai",
   "hash": "3570a1666383bc3c2aec70d9017406836d777973c86400f6d6f69b0cdc983704",
   "id": "s1-p4",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 4,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "Teaching a model to be harmless needs people to read and label h",
   "hash": "fffd501e95ef417ce000f0be131696be133ba0a140b35bbff0cdeb01f7101efe",
   "id": "s1-p5",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 5,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "The running example is a red-team prompt, a request written to d",
   "hash": "98c8343e8968d9dec787ca7d5319c014af5dbbfb69e3f561a418e8bcfe747790",
   "id": "s1-p6",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 6,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": "caiFig1",
   "fp": "Figure 1. A red-team prompt asks how to break into a neighbour’s",
   "hash": "521f8238fd967e65dc39f2c305a8d42235665178305707b9fac34f7035209fac",
   "id": "s1-f1",
   "kind": "figure",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "No label comes with this reply: a person would have to read it a",
   "hash": "255ec912e3e57cb7e90dddae265083cf7e2b4b47d4eb7fc3c485e69b5430dd19",
   "id": "s1-p7",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 7,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": "reward-pipeline",
   "fp": "1.1The reward model and RLHF behind it",
   "hash": "4376a84cd9f7a01494979a724f53d7a812f930dfcdbf15c785e9707a46ff6785",
   "id": "s1-h1",
   "kind": "subhead",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "A reward model is a language model with a one-number output, tra",
   "hash": "49875f3014d1489897026eaefe1eb3f41ba14ee018580d2b27ca15d48bd1aa73",
   "id": "s1-p8",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 8,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "RLHF, reinforcement learning from human feedback, trains a langu",
   "hash": "f140bd9a148761b6d606da5eb396b7a0e1abc576ceeca4a00054f5d2a3f7ee4d",
   "id": "s1-p9",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 9,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "Constitutional AI keeps that pipeline but lets a model, not peop",
   "hash": "be330b31830afa2a8e1b95d5219a354b9c15e5369f8f106cc1c901fa431977f1",
   "id": "s1-p10",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 10,
   "section": 1
  },
  {
   "domId": "constitution",
   "fp": "2Write the rules down once",
   "hash": "239e1aae32c84c6942ded55c6fec7dfbfe0271647c501d2564d97baff34d81a7",
   "id": "s2-title",
   "kind": "section_title",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 2
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "Two lists of rules, one per stage",
   "hash": "5c615fb0d8562c150c6fd7385d328c8dcb802726d576ac6f27e0248817750573",
   "id": "s2-p1",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 2
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "What. Picture two short lists of principles, written in plain la",
   "hash": "b0253daa53fa7115cb887dcdcea64619c4330a12c1271d14ce382ff29304493a",
   "id": "s2-p2",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 2,
   "section": 2
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "How. Each stage uses its own list: stage 1 revises replies again",
   "hash": "5ae9cf3e49c5dd7a0047b2c37982616a1de52708f42859ccb5939ba4d7236387",
   "id": "s2-p3",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 3,
   "section": 2
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "Why. When it works, the rules stay visible and editable: change ",
   "hash": "6e3f466ab4d439f73d0d666caba8448c95ab14a0cd912de3f642e4e3ce21bde2",
   "id": "s2-p4",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 4,
   "section": 2
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "A constitution is two short lists of principles written in plain",
   "hash": "b79cad5d3b93fec6ae858395cef8c4a51bb61379bf1b78de3520a37f07068063",
   "id": "s2-p5",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 5,
   "section": 2
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "A model’s labels are called AI feedback, and these AI labels rep",
   "hash": "39ba4ec7babe17b3bb435766ecf233c7c982153a2f55d031ba632a3400700cb8",
   "id": "s2-p6",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 6,
   "section": 2
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "The feedback model is a language model that reads a principle an",
   "hash": "ed09fd491a049e46910c71d810f88e08a52b98ac3b5a3ab87f1874451792c274",
   "id": "s2-p7",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 7,
   "section": 2
  },
  {
   "domId": "fig-cai",
   "fp": "Figure 2. Two stages, each with its own list of 16 principles pl",
   "hash": "6e88831b9a954638c3cc1987195beeba50909bd667c665920e5be653632da498",
   "id": "s2-f1",
   "kind": "figure",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 2
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "On the wifi prompt, stage 1 revises the break-in reply under one",
   "hash": "274c6f5bdc1616094f71cd71bbb46860998c676c50f2d80aa284e60f339e11c4",
   "id": "s2-p8",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 8,
   "section": 2
  },
  {
   "domId": "equations",
   "fp": "3Turning a model’s choice into a soft label",
   "hash": "45116f2d0ae9e87f171bf142d21942ccf372aa9844bee5e5269d4f8cddcf4c0a",
   "id": "s3-title",
   "kind": "section_title",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "Stage 1 revises the break-in reply into one that declines, and s",
   "hash": "e85d6c4ea69076b54260e87bea4ad2ff690ab70d5d1e7b5718335552735c279f",
   "id": "s3-p1",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "domId": "ai-labels",
   "fp": "3.1Asking the feedback model (A) or (B)",
   "hash": "d1459065f2283c0ede1617df5a0eeca4bb663b2b22577116c9cc559c70fe6ad8",
   "id": "s3-h1",
   "kind": "subhead",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "Two leans become one chance",
   "hash": "eb7690775dea6da1fa70ac7729d31e6bb28193708a4524ce2b89872b70626f8e",
   "id": "s3-p2",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 2,
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "What. Picture the feedback model asked which of two wifi replies",
   "hash": "3646254fb361bbf7e762023c13203c81abcb05812b3426620055585c259fad5e",
   "id": "s3-p3",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 3,
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "How. Each reply gets a lean, the log of the model’s chance of an",
   "hash": "9d5a21a80612ba9aea5f0d943747240f3ac377ea24afd97a7105715d89f7fb33",
   "id": "s3-p4",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 4,
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "Why. When it works, the label reads near one for a strong lean a",
   "hash": "1af43a0e79753f7700c7777b142bb944a5f0127ccbde14cfa2d935826e86d321",
   "id": "s3-p5",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 5,
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "The feedback model reads a principle, the prompt and two replies",
   "hash": "efb5101fab4d3874851b71d6d245fc4a983e721a4bb80e51fa3c7a62475abfb8",
   "id": "s3-p6",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 6,
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "On this site the loss RLHF uses to train its reward model is the",
   "hash": "0058223a509306c69a4d451049eab712f3cc6bb29599f3bd53fdc3b26f03df69",
   "id": "s3-p7",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 7,
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "So a label near one half sets only a small gap between the two s",
   "hash": "77e6372e5cb24a4cd29a9d6ff149c3b160add69e645af1f05f0f4853051a7987",
   "id": "s3-p8",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 8,
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "cardOrdinal": 1,
   "domId": "eq-soft-label",
   "fp": "Equation 1. The AI soft label. Stage 2 has no person to label a ",
   "hash": "9f50cc99752efad5488785ac53c8ec9c33de40e222c0cd6789c332c35310561d",
   "id": "s3-e1",
   "kind": "equation",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "Equation 1. The AI soft label. Stage 2 has no person to label a ",
   "hash": "2874e1cf89b852c8648f6d1ec8f02a25d432d9b54a078cfcfd9ba6d93ecb80ff",
   "id": "s3-p9",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 9,
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "cardOrdinal": 1,
   "domId": null,
   "eqLine": "0",
   "fp": "Intuition. A lean is how strongly the feedback model favours one",
   "hash": "8e248ea1327ccaf11bcf98b68d63dbf648855e5abbf8aa3f826644a04ab5c86b",
   "id": "s3-e1-l0",
   "kind": "eqwhy",
   "labeled": true,
   "labels": [
    "Intuition.",
    "The mathematics.",
    "Example."
   ],
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "cardOrdinal": 1,
   "domId": null,
   "eqLine": "1",
   "fp": "Intuition. One lean alone cannot say how sure the model is: a le",
   "hash": "7883da8ad91eabe09837facc855c1af597204b5b5d12c30e520323baeb762618",
   "id": "s3-e1-l1",
   "kind": "eqwhy",
   "labeled": true,
   "labels": [
    "Intuition.",
    "The mathematics.",
    "Example."
   ],
   "ordinal": 2,
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "cardOrdinal": 1,
   "domId": null,
   "eqLine": "2",
   "fp": "Intuition. Two leans combine into one number, the soft label, wh",
   "hash": "39522b890009bcae5dc1c47bc659537eaa50397506e071074cd748b1aaf18262",
   "id": "s3-e1-l2",
   "kind": "eqwhy",
   "labeled": true,
   "labels": [
    "Intuition.",
    "The mathematics.",
    "Example."
   ],
   "ordinal": 3,
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "domId": "how-it-works",
   "fp": "4Critique, revise, then let a model label",
   "hash": "6b73339f865e069d13315a49d131e2fce8fe22d8a6c868d506ad623b77a8b9e9",
   "id": "s4-title",
   "kind": "section_title",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "Critique, revise, fine-tune",
   "hash": "909123857a8679b9817c68d882ae0b12e8d327e668a8b30115e7904180a7d7cf",
   "id": "s4-p1",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 1,
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "What. Picture the model reading its own break-in reply against o",
   "hash": "b5a2135cf8272411707103ed58223ece5769ab64e5bbdc8a7ebca5741c1a2db9",
   "id": "s4-p2",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 2,
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "How. The model draws a principle at random, writes a critique of",
   "hash": "e721150d191deabac48edd536606515c36976487ced56039c69be2921189d8a0",
   "id": "s4-p3",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 3,
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "Why. When it works, the first revision almost always removes mos",
   "hash": "89a388b52deeaf6ea3c0949b2c17f97862356899aba3a00550d831e6f722cbbf",
   "id": "s4-p4",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 4,
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "The harmful reply in Figure 1 is many tokens long, and only one ",
   "hash": "624cafd4ac7a56f2ae8ba162df88e8ffb076e289119a587e5a81a074a4bc5010",
   "id": "s4-p5",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 5,
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "The preference model is trained on the feedback model’s choices ",
   "hash": "7d973da7a1c408ca5c8e3f7df18543a818b51c1ff3fcd96fcf2d72823eebfdbf",
   "id": "s4-p6",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 6,
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "domId": null,
   "fp": "Training on the model’s own revisions, mixed with helpful replie",
   "hash": "2d488dd8dca4b2f4da7ed2a80df26b557d06009d682ccbd14fabc38aa9353b75",
   "id": "s4-p7",
   "kind": "prose",
   "ordinal": 7,
   "section": 4
  },
  {
